# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Never commit real values.
# Then: npm run preflight   (tells you exactly what is still missing)
#       npm run dev:live    (real Gemini sandbox + Solana devnet)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gemini (SANDBOX only)
# Create the key in a Gemini SANDBOX account, not production. The key MUST have "time-based nonce" enabled
# (the executor signs with Unix seconds), and needs trading and balance-read permissions.
# Paste both values with no quotes or spaces. Gemini shows the secret only once.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_SECRET=

# Extra demo accounts (optional). Name them anything: GEMINI_USER_ALICE_KEY / GEMINI_USER_ALICE_SECRET
# GEMINI_USER_ALICE_KEY=
# GEMINI_USER_ALICE_SECRET=

# Real prices and order books with no keys at all, every order refused:  npm run dev:quotes
# The sandbox's books are about 20 cents wide, so the value rule would refuse nearly every pair. dev:live and
# dev:quotes waive ONLY the markup check, on the sandbox only. The verdict shown is never softened.
# GIVEN_SANDBOX_WAIVE_MARKUP=1

# NEVER set these without both teammates agreeing: production means real money.
# GEMINI_BASE_URL=
# GIVEN_ALLOW_PRODUCTION=1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Solana (devnet)
# The authority key is made by:  cd chain && npm run keygen   (stored in chain/data/, git-ignored)
# Fund its public key at https://faucet.solana.com (network: devnet), then: cd chain && npm run smoke
# The public devnet RPC is rate limited. A QuickNode devnet endpoint URL is a better choice.
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
# Optional: have Victor's deployed program check every record on chain (each call then holds about 0.002 SOL of rent).
# Unset: records are Memos only. Verified on devnet with our own key on 2026-11-18.
# GIVEN_PROGRAM_ID=8q9jn7HyWs9HCFvS2N3RpRtZBuUdJHCeVq4Yp4Hs1YNK

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- QuickNode Stream (needs a hosted chain service)
# Security token shown when you create the Stream. Deliveries are refused until one of these is set.
# QN_SECURITY_TOKEN=
# Or a shared token you choose, sent as "Authorization: Bearer <token>" or "X-Given-Token":
# GIVEN_HOOK_TOKEN=
# Leaderboard needs this many revealed calls before a player appears (default 1):
# GIVEN_LB_MIN_CALLS=3
